        "description": "AI-powered refinement for goals and roles - generate, refine, consolidate operations.\n\n**Authentication Required:** All endpoints require Bearer token authentication (MVP-AUTH-005).\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n1. Register user via 00-authentication collection\n2. Login to get access token\n3. Set {{access_token}} variable in environment\n\n**Security:**\n- All routes protected by auth middleware\n- Agency-scoped access control",
